      "type": "split",
      "html": "<h2><strong>Project Highlights:</strong></h2><p><strong>User-Centric Interface:</strong> <br/>Designed an intuitive and visually appealing interface that provides comprehensive visibility into inventory levels. This enhances user experience by simplifying complex data into actionable insights, improving decision-making and operational efficiency.<br/><br/><strong>Seamless Interaction: <br/></strong>Developed a smooth and responsive user interface that ensures precise and real-time tracking of inventory movements. This interaction design focuses on user needs, making the system easy to navigate and highly efficient.<br/><br/><strong>Intelligent Automation:</strong> <br/><br/>Created a user-friendly AI-driven automated replenishment system. Our design reduces manual workload and minimizes the risk of stockouts by providing clear, actionable notifications and streamlined workflows.</p>",
